---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
const url = (path) => `${base}${path}`;
---
<BaseLayout title='Online Physiotherapy — Miles Physio' description='Personal online physiotherapy with Chris Miles. Book a 45-minute initial assessment for £65 or a 30-minute follow-up for £40.' bodyClass='online-page' styles={['/online.css?v=1']} apos={false}>
<main id="main">
<section class="section online-hero">
<div class="breadcrumb"><a href={url('/')}>Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Online physiotherapy</span></div>
<div class="online-hero-grid hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="mini-line"></span> Online physiotherapy</p><h1>Personal care.<br>In your<br><em>own space.</em></h1></div><div class="online-hero-copy"><p class="large-copy">Time to talk things through. Space to understand what’s happening. A clear plan for moving forward.</p><p>Connect with Chris Miles, Clinical Director, from home for physiotherapy built around you and the things you want to get back to.</p><div class="online-actions"><a class="button" href="https://miles-physio.uk1.cliniko.com/bookings">Book an online appointment <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a class="down-link" href="#how-it-works">How it works <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 4v16M5 13l7 7 7-7"/></svg></span></a></div></div></div>
<figure class="consultation-visual hero-visual"><img src={url('/assets/online-consultation.jpg')} width="1536" height="1024" alt="AI illustration of Chris Miles speaking with a fictional client over a video call at home" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption><span>Online physiotherapy.<br>Personal care, wherever you feel comfortable.</span></figcaption></figure>
<div class="online-hero-foot"><span>One-to-one care with Chris Miles</span><span>Secure video appointments</span></div>
</section>
<section class="section online-intro"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>01 / Care that fits your life</span><span>A little closer to home</span></div><div class="intro-grid"><h2 class="reveal">Make room<br>for recovery.<br><span class="blue">Without the journey.</span></h2><div class="copy reveal"><p class="large-copy">When your diary is full or travelling feels difficult, getting support can become another thing to put off.</p><p>Online appointments bring the conversation into your own space. Whether your goal is getting back to exercise, feeling more comfortable at work or enjoying everyday activities, that’s where we start.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="how-it-works" class="online-process"><div class="section"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>02 / How it works</span><span>From your first call onwards</span></div><h2 class="reveal">A conversation. An assessment.<br><span class="blue">Your next steps.</span></h2><ol class="process-grid"><li class="reveal"><span class="process-number">01</span><h3>Book your<br>appointment</h3><p>Choose a time online. You’ll receive a secure video link to join your consultation.</p></li><li class="reveal"><span class="process-number">02</span><h3>Help us understand<br>the problem</h3><p>Chris will discuss your symptoms and history, observe your movement and explore how the problem affects you.</p></li><li class="reveal"><span class="process-number">03</span><h3>Put your plan<br>into practice</h3><p>Your plan may include exercises, ways to manage symptoms yourself and adjustments to everyday activities.</p></li><li class="reveal"><span class="process-number">04</span><h3>Review<br>and progress</h3><p>Follow-up appointments give you time to discuss what’s working and adapt your treatment as you progress.</p></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="section chris-section online-chris"><div class="portrait-wrap reveal"><img src={url('/assets/chris.jpg')} alt="Chris Miles, Clinical Director at Miles Physio" width="998" height="1500" loading="lazy"><div class="portrait-caption"><strong>Chris Miles</strong><span>Clinical Director</span></div></div><div class="chris-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Your physiotherapist</p><h2>Meet Chris.<br><span class="blue">Then take it<br>from there.</span></h2><p class="large-copy">You don’t need to know exactly what’s wrong or have the right words to describe it.</p><p>Bring your questions, your concerns and an idea of what you’d like to change. Chris will help you work through them, with clear explanations and time to ask questions.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/about/')}>More about Chris <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div></section>
<section id="appointments" class="online-pricing"><div class="section"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>03 / Appointments &amp; pricing</span><span>One-to-one. By video.</span></div><div class="pricing-heading"><h2 class="reveal">Clear prices.<br><span class="blue">Time dedicated to you.</span></h2><p class="reveal">Both appointments take place<br>by secure video call.</p></div><div class="price-grid"><article class="price-card reveal"><div class="price-top"><h3>Initial assessment</h3><span>45 minutes</span></div><p class="price">£65<span>per appointment</span></p><p class="price-description">Assessment, advice and a treatment plan.</p><a class="button" href="https://miles-physio.uk1.cliniko.com/bookings">Book your first appointment <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></article><article class="price-card follow-up reveal"><div class="price-top"><h3>Follow-up appointment</h3><span>30 minutes</span></div><p class="price">£40<span>per appointment</span></p><p class="price-description">Reviewing progress and adjusting your plan.</p><a class="button" href="https://miles-physio.uk1.cliniko.com/bookings">Book a follow-up <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section preparation"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>04 / Before your appointment</span><span>Ready when you are</span></div><div class="intro-grid"><h2 class="reveal">A little preparation.<br><span class="blue">A more<br>comfortable call.</span></h2><div class="prep-list reveal"><div><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><p>Have a phone, tablet or computer with a camera and microphone ready, along with a reliable internet connection.</p></div><div><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><p>Choose a quiet space with enough room to move and wear comfortable clothing.</p></div><div><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><p>It can also help to jot down your questions beforehand.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="online-faq"><div class="section"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>05 / Your questions</span><span>Let’s talk it through</span></div><div class="faq-grid"><div class="reveal"><h2>A few things<br>you might be<br><span class="blue">wondering.</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@milesphysio.com">Contact Miles Physio <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div><div class="journey reveal"><details><summary>Can physiotherapy work over video?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><p>A video appointment allows Chris to discuss your symptoms, watch you move and guide your treatment. Some problems require an in-person examination; if online care isn’t appropriate, the next step is to discuss suitable alternatives.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to be exercising already?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><p>Your starting point is your own. The conversation begins with what you can currently do and what you want to work towards.</p></details><details><summary>What if I’m unsure about booking?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><p>Get in touch first. Tell us a little about what’s troubling you so we can help you decide on the next step.</p></details></div></div></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact-section"><div class="contact-inner reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Let’s make your<br><span>next step clearer.</span></h2><div class="contact-copy"><p>Tell us what’s getting in the way.<br>We’ll start there.</p><a class="button white-button" href="https://miles-physio.uk1.cliniko.com/bookings">Book your online appointment <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><p class="contact-direct"><a href="tel:+447980700940">07980 700 940</a><br><a href="mailto:info@milesphysio.com">info@milesphysio.com</a></p></div></div><div class="contact-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
